# Only the invite path is handled by the app rather than by a file.
#
# This was `/*  /index.html  200`, which was too wide: it also swallowed real
# files. /version.json came back as the app shell, so the update check compared
# its build against a page of HTML and never saw an update. A wildcard also
# turns every typo into a silent copy of the app instead of a 404.
#
# The 200 makes it a rewrite rather than a redirect, so the address bar keeps
# the token, which is the only place the token ever lives.
/i/*  /index.html  200
